{
  "version": "demo-badge-v0",
  "_comment": [
    "AN ARTIFICIAL DEMO BADGE. This is not the DoseBand product badge and its",
    "layout carries no chemical meaning. It exists so that milestone M0A has a",
    "concrete, versioned geometry to exercise the deterministic pipeline",
    "against, and so that no ROI coordinate has to appear in Dart source.",
    "",
    "The real badge geometry is blocked on the cartridge design, and is",
    "additionally blocked on GATE S1 (research/gates/s1-passive-uptake.md):",
    "whether the aperture carries a diffusion barrier changes the physical",
    "layout, so freezing a geometry now would be premature.",
    "",
    "Reference patch layout note: the six patches are three neutrals plus",
    "three chromatic. Neutrals alone are collinear in RGB and cannot",
    "constrain a colour correction - see the all-neutral rejection test in",
    "packages/measurement/test/colour/reference_correction_test.dart."
  ],
